{"guid":"sbr-1to1-+16263582053-0","timestamp_unix_ms":1785556557578,"direction":"incoming","service":"sms","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":"+16263582053","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"He did everything best in the world; and she was sure he would kill more birds on the first of September than anybody else in the country. Are you going much farther?","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"sbr-1to1-+16263582053-1","timestamp_unix_ms":1785559257578,"direction":"outgoing","service":"sms","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":null,"sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"You are all to come to Pemberley at Christmas.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"sbr-1to1-+16263582053-2","timestamp_unix_ms":1785561935578,"direction":"outgoing","service":"sms","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":null,"sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"They then sat down, and when her inquiries after Rosings were made, seemed in danger of sinking into total silence.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"sbr-1to1-+16263582053-3","timestamp_unix_ms":1786185559578,"direction":"incoming","service":"sms","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":"+16263582053","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"Long does not keep a carriage, and had to come to the ball in a hack chaise.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"sbr-1to1-+16263582053-4","timestamp_unix_ms":1786195972578,"direction":"outgoing","service":"sms","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":null,"sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"I feel as if I had never done you justice, or loved you as you deserve.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"sbr-1to1-+16263582053-5","timestamp_unix_ms":1786198310578,"direction":"outgoing","service":"sms","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":null,"sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"I thought too ill of him to invite him to Pemberley, or admit his society in town. Your uncle is as much surprised as I am; and nothing but the belief of your being a party concerned would have allowed him to act as he has done.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"sbr-1to1-+16263582053-6","timestamp_unix_ms":1786199766578,"direction":"incoming","service":"sms","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":"+16263582053","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":" \"Miss Bingley,\" said he, \"has given me credit for more than can be.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"sbr-1to1-+16263582053-7","timestamp_unix_ms":1786253647578,"direction":"outgoing","service":"sms","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":null,"sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"We all love to instruct, though we can teach only what is not worth knowing.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
